v1.0:
* Initial release.

v1.1:
* Fix CPUSetCollector that was getting stuck if perftune.py execution was failing.
* New ClientConnectionCollector and DriverVersionAnalyzer added.

v1.2:
* Added new Collectors:
  * GossipInfoCollector
  * TokenMetadataHostsMappingCollector
  * RaftGroup0Collector
  * SystemPeersLocalCollector
  * SystemClusterStatusCollector
* Added new TopologyConsistencyAnalyzer.
* Fixes:
  * SD fails to collect info using CQL on hosts that have different values for broadcast_rpc_address and rpc_address: GH12.

v1.3:
* Added Collectors:
  * SystemConfigCollector: collects Scylla actual (in-memory) configuration state.
  * InfrastructureProviderCollector: collect CPU platform where possible.

* Added Analyzers:
  * CloudCPUPlatformAnalyzer: verifies that the CPU platform is as expected.
  * ScyllaConfigurationConsistencyAnalyzer: verifies a consistency of a persisted and actual (in-memory) Scylla
    configuration. Fixes GH18 and GH55.
  * RaftEnablementAnalyzer: verifies that Raft is properly enabled. Fixes GH29.

* Fixes:
  * NICCollector fails where there are bond interfaces in the system: GH20.
  * PerftuneAnalyzer: reduce false-alarming: related to GH7.
  * RaftGroup0Collector and TopologyConsistencyAnalyzer is not applicable to non-Raft cluster: GH19.
  * Add AWS i4i and Azure Lsv3 instances to supported instances list.
  * HypervisorTypeCollector: ignore non-zero exit code of systemd-detect-virt on non-VM hosts: GH47.
  * NodeInstanceTypeAnalyzer: fix Azure instance names: GH25.

v1.4:
* Fixes:
  * NodeInstanceTypeAnalyzer: add i3.large to the list of supported instance types: GH65
  * SwapAnalyzer: make ram_swap_ratio a floating point value: GH64
  * Analyzers: make sure error messages printing bad and expected sizes print them as differently looking values: GH66

v1.5:
* Added Collectors:
  * NTP status collector by @vreniers in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/88.
  * ScyllaConfigurationFileNoParsingCollector by @vladzcloudius in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/92:
    needed for ScyllaConfigurationFileFormatAnalyzer.

* Added Analyzers:
  * NTP status analyzer by @vreniers in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/88.
  * ScyllaConfigurationFileFormatAnalyzer by @vladzcloudius in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/92:
    validate 'restriction mode' configuration values format in scylla.yaml.

* Fixes:
  * scylla-doctor: README.md: add a note about variables expansion in configuration files by @vladzcloudius in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/74.
  * scylla-doctor: ScyllaConfigurationConsistencyAnalyzer: use safe dict dereferencing by @vladzcloudius in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/75.
  * scylla-doctor-cluster: error when no .vitals.json files are detected by @vreniers in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/79.
  * scylla-doctor: ScyllaConfigurationConsistencyAnalyzer: ignore keys that are not present in system.config by @vladzcloudius in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/85.
  * scylla-doctor-cluster/README.md: add missing quoting in the 'mask' example by @vladzcloudius in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/90.
  * ScyllaConfigurationConsistencyAnalyzer: correctly handle 'restriction mode' values by @vladzcloudius in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/92.
  * scylla-doctor: bump up minimum recommendations for sstable format and scylla versions by @vladzcloudius in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/96.
  * scylla-doctor-cluster: Configuration: missing exception variable by @vreniers in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/97.
  * scylla-doctor: ScyllaSSTablesAnalyzer: Detect unrecommended format by @vreniers in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/99.
  * scylla-doctor-cluster: print number of vitals files by @vladzcloudius in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/102.
  * scylla-doctor: ClockSourceAnalyzer: add 'hyperv_clocksource_tsc_page' to recommended sources by @vladzcloudius in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/103.

v1.6:
* Fixes:
  * scylla-doctor: test/requirements.txt: add two modules required for U24.04 based images by @vladzcloudius in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/113
  * scylla-doctor: CPUSetCollector: skip the collector if '--cpuset' is not set in CPUSET by @vladzcloudius in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/119
  * OSSupportAnalyzer: Add support for newer editions by @vreniers in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/122
  * scylla-doctor: Makefile: add support for Podman by @vreniers in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/127
  * scylla-doctor: skip tests on the basis of docker or podman environment by @vreniers in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/128
  * scylla-doctor: read_cql_table automatically map column values to column names by @vreniers in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/124
  * scylla-doctor: use the location of Scylla binaries from the configuration by @vladzcloudius in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/134
  * scylla-doctor: increase query execution timeout to 300 seconds as a temporary workaround for issue #135 by @vladzcloudius in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/138
  * scylla-doctor: Don't intercept exceptions by @vladzcloudius in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/139

* Refactoring:
  * [scylla-doctor] move utils, cloud providers and collectors to their own modules by @tarzanek in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/86
  * [scylla-doctor] print out collectors from new file too in help by @tarzanek in https://github.com/scylladb/scylla-doctor/pull/121

