      not supported.
* Fixes:
  * Multiple minor fixes related to execution on root-less systems in #218
  * Fix gossip info collector to allow missing gossiper application states in #219 and #220
  * Improve the Cloud Provider metadata read requests timeout configuration in #220
  * PerftuneSystemConfigurationCollector: don't error out if can't read some sysfs files in #221

